1. Initialize a Git repository for the Go project.  

Commands:
git init
git status

A local git repo will be created and the project files are shown as untracked/modified files.

2. Create a professional README.md

Steps:
    1. Create a README.md file
    2. Add project title
    3. Add project description
    4. Add instructions
    5. Save the file

Commands:
